# Design Details modules

| Piece | Responsibility | Entry |
|-------|----------------|--------|
| Markup | `#page-details`, lightbox, wrist guide | `pages/details/page.html` |
| Boot / UI | Mount, rename, BOM, shares, bottom bar | `pages/details/index.js` |
| BOM | Aggregate beads by SKU | `pages/details/bom.js` |

Do not put DIY canvas/shelf code here. Navigate via `shared/nav.js` (`showDiyPage` / `showDetailsPage`).

## Contracts

- **Open**: from DIY Make Now with ≥1 bead; snapshot via `getDesignImage()`
- **Continue / Back**: return to DIY; design store unchanged
- **Make Now (footer)**: Shopify checkout stub
- **Share / Submit / CS**: stubs until wired
